{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-29T01:01:59.107Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"7e76872b6ce869fed4ec0732","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-29T01:01:59.105Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"Implemented typed compareSemanticAssets/renderSemanticAssetReport plus semantic-diff CLI, strict bounded static SVG grammar, grouped visible outline metadata and geometry digests, localized text/token/geometry/accessibility evidence, JSON/TOON output via SDK accounting, typed refusals and remedies. Focused 15/15 tests, typecheck, lint and docstrings passed. New modules measured 100/100/100/100 coverage. The 500-sequence model completed 6000 transitions, 997 older-input replays and 500 complete native SDK read-backs with relationships, fields and ambient focus preserved. Behavioral reverts caught 4/4 independent faults; restored implementation passed the unchanged regressions. Public read-only non-git tracker: 16 items, 48 generated source assets, 48 comparisons (16 identity/0 changes, 16 serialization/0 changes, 16 edits/32 findings), 96 reports, max 94 SDK estimated tokens/375 bytes, zero budget refusals; SDK state and byte hashes unchanged. See docs/semantic-assets-validation.md. Runtime is read-only and creates no import/export/sync journal, idempotency key, claim, lease or shared product state. No transaction-isolation or atomic snapshot claim; each supplied SVG string is caller-owned input. Full npm/Bun release gates are delegated to exact-head CI per the host resource constraint."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-29T01:01:59.107Z"}],"before_hash":"cb17afccfb66c7893afcdc5af93b6fc5d65ddbfb95cd309264ad6137d41677a5","af